//! `voxel-texgraph`: deterministic node-graph texture and bake core.
//!
//! This crate has no GUI dependency. The `texgen` desktop editor and the
//! viewer's `bake-atlas` command both call into it, so a button press, a CLI
//! run and CI cannot disagree about generated bytes.

